# Error(code, text) takes a standard code too; the code of a class of the program is made by the class
** spec: semantics/errors.md#errors-of-a-program
primary aspect c75_error_constructor_code is
  process main is
    raise Error(17, "fine");
  recover
    print $error.code;
    raise Error(140, "unknown");
  return;
end c75_error_constructor_code;
/*@expect
{
  "syntax_error": true,
  "exit": 65,
  "contains": ["140 is not an error code"]
}
